%% SEQ-06: Device-aware I/O guarded actuation
%% Behavior trace is in 02_Requirements/AIOS_Requirement_Behavior_Traceability.csv
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant POL as Policy Service
    participant ACT as Resource Manager / Actuator
    participant K as cgroups v2 I/O
    participant AUD as Audit DB
    POL->>ACT: Bounded request with cgroup and device identity
    ACT->>ACT: Authenticate, revalidate target, bounds, mode and ownership
    ACT->>K: Check controller and device capability
    alt Unsupported device/controller or failed guard
        ACT->>AUD: Deny, retain recommendation, no write
    else Supported and authorized
        ACT->>K: Read prior io.weight/io.max for exact device
        K-->>ACT: Device-scoped prior value
        ACT->>K: Apply bounded device-specific value
        ACT->>K: Read back the same device control
        alt Verified
            ACT->>AUD: Record device, old/new values and outcome
        else Failure
            ACT->>ACT: Recheck cgroup, device identity and ownership
            opt All checks still match
                ACT->>K: Restore prior value for same device and verify
            end
            ACT->>AUD: Record failure and guarded recovery
        end
    end
